[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8822.79, "timestamp": "02:27:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8831.11, "timestamp": "02:27:11", "text": "太好了。如果你找到了，请告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8833.67, "timestamp": "02:27:13", "text": "任何有趣的东西。人们发现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8836.389, "timestamp": "02:27:16", "text": "当它出现时，经常会发现一些文物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8839.75, "timestamp": "02:27:19", "text": "完毕。球看着蜜蜂跳上来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8842.309, "timestamp": "02:27:22", "text": "河流。我也是这么想的。我敢肯定"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8846.72, "timestamp": "02:27:26", "text": "钓鱼的时候你会找到一些。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8868.55, "timestamp": "02:27:48", "text": "如何下去？呃，"}]